### Create a movie (admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/movies
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 0f8d7c1a-0000-4000-8000-00000000a001
X-User-Role: ADMIN

{"title": "Kalki 2898 AD", "durationMin": 181, "certification": "UA", "releaseDate": "2024-06-27"}

> {% client.global.set("movieId", response.body.id); %}

### Update it
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/movies/{{movieId}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 0f8d7c1a-0000-4000-8000-00000000a001
X-User-Role: ADMIN

{"title": "Kalki 2898 AD", "durationMin": 176, "certification": "UA", "releaseDate": "2024-06-27"}

### Movie details (customer)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/movies/{{movieId}}
X-User-Id: 5b1e3f60-0000-4000-8000-00000000c001
X-User-Role: CUSTOMER

### Deactivate it
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/movies/{{movieId}}/deactivate
X-User-Id: 0f8d7c1a-0000-4000-8000-00000000a001
X-User-Role: ADMIN
